id: copy-in-the-mirror
name: Copy in the Mirror
talentCategory: racial
race: glass-tribe
prerequisites: Glass Tribe, Autonomous Glass Soldiers Talent
description: >
  Taking direct control over one of your Glass Soldiers, you create a second self.
text: >
  Copy in the Mirror: Taking direct control over one of your Glass Soldiers, you create a second self.
  –Prerequisites: Glass Tribe, Autonomous Glass Soldiers Talent
  (1)-[Triggered, Ruling]: If you would create a Glass Knight, you may spend 4(bT) Ki Points to instead create a Duplicate Minion of yourself known as a ‘Glass Copy’.
  (2)-[Passive]: Your Glass Copies are treated as Glass Knights for all of your effects.

---

[passive]
# (1) Asked as Autonomous Glass Soldiers (1) creates them: how many are Glass Copies instead, 4(bT) Ki more each (chat.mjs
# glassKnights). The Duplicate Minion itself the table's.
allow glass.copies;
# (2) The table's, as the Glass Knights are.
